{"type":"text","timestamp":1794522275513,"sessionID":"ses_e2e2a7f1fffe9admTsfI03Rp1i","part":{"id":"prt_1d1dcd07a0014CyKaLV9uUaRxV","sessionID":"ses_e2e2a7f1fffe9admTsfI03Rp1i","messageID":"msg_1d1dc9c14001apol9mOPQeRy8C","type":"text","text":"T002 complete.\n\n**Files written** (both under the phase `scratch/` folder):\n- `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/scratch/brief-heads.mjs`\n- `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/scratch/brief-heads-before.txt`\n\nThe probe pipes the five non-skipped prompts from the `spec.md` measured block plus `research caching strategies in depth over several iterations` through `.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/claude/user-prompt-submit.js` and prints only the first line of each `additionalContext`.\n\n**Verify output**\n```\n       6\nAdvisor: live; use command-spec-kit-plan 0.82/0.16 pass.\nFIRST LINE MATCH\nSIX LINES\n```\n\nThe captured file content:\n```\nAdvisor: live; use command-spec-kit-plan 0.82/0.16 pass.\nAdvisor: live; use command-speckit-save 0.89/0.12 pass.\nAdvisor: live; use sk-prompt 0.89/0.12 pass.\nAdvisor: live; use sk-doc 0.95/0.12 pass.\nAdvisor: live; ambiguous: /doctor:git hooks 0.82/0.12 vs sk-git 0.86/0.16 pass.\nAdvisor: live; use system-deep-loop 0.82/0.16 pass.\n```\n\n**Environment note:** the first hook call answered `Advisor: stale` because the persisted skill-graph signature no longer matched current sources. I ran the documented recovery call `node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs skill_graph_scan --trusted ...`, which refreshed gitignored advisor runtime state (generation 83 → 85) and made `advisor_status` report `live`; the probe then produced the expected heads. No tracked source files changed and `tasks.md` was not ticked.","time":{"start":1794522271866,"end":1794522275513}}}
